      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "ring",
          "title": "literal:Build the loop",
          "groups": [
            "ring"
          ],
          "text": "literal:Guide rings in a loop. Each corner is two rings set diagonally, both right-clicked to bend toward each other."
        },
        {
          "id": "parts",
          "title": "literal:Motors and a sensor",
          "groups": [
            "parts"
          ],
          "text": "literal:Motors and sensors work as straight track. A comparator on the sensor shows the speed."
        },
        {
          "id": "controllers",
          "title": "literal:Two controllers",
          "groups": [
            "controllers"
          ],
          "text": "literal:Each controller sits outside the loop with its back against a straight ring."
        },
        {
          "id": "run",
          "title": "literal:Speed it up",
          "text": "literal:Put one item in a controller. It gains speed each time it passes a powered motor.",
          "markers": [
            {
              "block": "controller_a",
              "icon": "right_click",
              "item": "oritech:coal_dust",
              "text": "literal:First item"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "collide",
          "title": "literal:Collide",
          "text": "literal:Once it's fast enough, put the second item in the other controller. The result lands in an output slot.",
          "markers": [
            {
              "block": "controller_b",
              "icon": "right_click",
              "item": "oritech:coal_dust",
              "text": "literal:Second item"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "hero": true,
      "ratio": 0.83
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6,
      "y": 4,
      "width": 238,
      "text": "literal:A particle too fast for its next corner flies off and the item is lost. Faster particles need longer sides: this 11-wide loop holds about 500, 15 wide about 1,000, 22 wide 2,500, 30 wide 5,000 and 42 wide 10,000. A collision that's too slow, or a pair with no result, wastes both items."
    },
